==English==
===Symbol===
{{infl|en|symbol}} 
# Indicating a possessive, with ''s'' ([[’s]]).
# Indicating the omission of letters.
#: ''[[tho’|tho'''’''']]'', ''they[[’ll|'''’'''ll]]'', '''''’'''65''

===Usage notes===
When indicating a possessive and omission of letters, this symbol is called an [[apostrophe]].

